{"name": "Manaclysm", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer Magic Brawler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manaclysm is a PvP brawler where up to 60 mages wage war across realms fractured by magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"194\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ab10778a3ae7e3cb2c06c8d6d678574b.poster.avif?t=1779935067\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ab10778a3ae7e3cb2c06c8d6d678574b.webm?t=1779935067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ab10778a3ae7e3cb2c06c8d6d678574b.mp4?t=1779935067\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defeat Opponents, Learn New Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obliterate other mages to earn <strong>Sparks</strong>. Spend them between rounds to enhance your spell arsenal, or max out your <strong>Mana</strong> and lay waste to the whole arena!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/e87369364feb117885dbbe7bdfc9aff9.poster.avif?t=1779935067\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/e87369364feb117885dbbe7bdfc9aff9.webm?t=1779935067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/e87369364feb117885dbbe7bdfc9aff9.mp4?t=1779935067\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Counter-spell Combos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each match features a unique set of spells - combine them in creative ways to counter your adversaries and emerge victorious.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"194\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ec470dc56fddc0081a5ac0c819958ea5.poster.avif?t=1779935067\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ec470dc56fddc0081a5ac0c819958ea5.webm?t=1779935067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ec470dc56fddc0081a5ac0c819958ea5.mp4?t=1779935067\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Victory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash spell storms, obliterate your opponents, and emerge victorious!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"194\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/cb326b19979898965d386002d9f106a1.poster.avif?t=1779935067\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/cb326b19979898965d386002d9f106a1.webm?t=1779935067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/cb326b19979898965d386002d9f106a1.mp4?t=1779935067\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 - 60 players per match. Invite friends to a private game, or hop into ranked matchmaking for some massive brawls!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a new mage with a custom arsenal of spells each match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Jump, portal, and fly</i> around the arena while dodging a bullet-hell of arcane projectiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to pick up, hard to master gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features custom rollback netcode on dedicated servers. Another player's bad connection won't affect your latency</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Manaclysm is a PvP brawler where up to 60 mages wage war across realms fractured by magic. Slay enemy mages to upgrade your mana and spell arsenal. Invite friends to a private game, or hop into ranked matchmaking for some massive brawls!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/a76b77890bff2e7c380dbf07e5424658273de993/header.jpg?t=1779935067", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["2D Fighter", "Roguelite", "PvP", "Action", "Magic", "Multiplayer"], "developers": "Gamma Bear Games", "publishers": "Gamma Bear Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "1932520", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "15 May 2026 - Demo\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/4713460/Manaclysm_Demo/?curator_clanid=44917508", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/eRvIeqnejVc", "first_seen": 1778796000.0, "review_rank": 642}